{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017bp3Cn5Rd9f721CbgSJc19","type":"tool_result","content":"412\t/// callback (see [`StreamDataCallback`]).  Identifies which sort of\n413\t/// notification the stack is delivering — stream data, lifecycle\n414\t/// transition, datagram event, path event, etc.\n415\t#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]\n416\tpub enum CallbackEvent {\n417\t    StreamData = 0,\n418\t    StreamFin,\n419\t    StreamReset,\n420\t    StopSending,\n421\t    StatelessReset,\n422\t    Close,\n423\t    ApplicationClose,\n424\t    StreamGap,\n425\t    PrepareToSend,\n426\t    AlmostReady,\n427\t    Ready,\n428\t    Datagram,\n429\t    VersionNegotiation,\n430\t    RequestAlpnList,\n431\t    SetAlpn,\n432\t    PacingChanged,\n433\t    PrepareDatagram,\n434\t    DatagramAcked,\n435\t    DatagramLost,\n436\t    DatagramSpurious,\n437\t    PathAvailable,\n438\t    PathSuspended,\n439\t    PathDeleted,\n440\t    PathQualityChanged,\n441\t    PathAddressObserved,\n442\t    AppWakeup,\n443\t    NextPathAllowed,\n444\t}\n445\t\n446\t// Transport-parameter shapes live in [`crate::tp`]."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"513641af-66d9-4e8b-98cd-e59b8e6a1fb7","uuid":"fcd8a25c-ae38-4cd1-8e35-0bd13a494e7d","timestamp":"2026-05-04T22:30:36.463Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/rs/fq/src/lib.rs","content":"/// callback (see [`StreamDataCallback`]).  Identifies which sort of\n/// notification the stack is delivering — stream data, lifecycle\n/// transition, datagram event, path event, etc.\n#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]\npub enum CallbackEvent {\n    StreamData = 0,\n    StreamFin,\n    StreamReset,\n    StopSending,\n    StatelessReset,\n    Close,\n    ApplicationClose,\n    StreamGap,\n    PrepareToSend,\n    AlmostReady,\n    Ready,\n    Datagram,\n    VersionNegotiation,\n    RequestAlpnList,\n    SetAlpn,\n    PacingChanged,\n    PrepareDatagram,\n